	"title": "Reclaim 0.1.1-1573",
	"body": "<!-- synopkgland:release:synopackageland%2FSynoReclaim:0.1.1-1573 -->\n\nReclaim **0.1.1-1573**\n\n0.1.1-1573\n- Titled dialogs use DSM's 3px corners and stay within the DSM window.\n- Two messages that showed as raw keys now have text in every language.\n- Built on SDK 0.12.2 and UI 0.10.3; no new approval is needed after the upgrade from 0.1.1-1572.\n\nPackage: `synopackageland/SynoReclaim`\n\n[Browse packages](https://synopkgland.com/apps/)\n\n",
	"bodyHTML": "\n<p dir=\"auto\">Reclaim <strong>0.1.1-1573</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">0.1.1-1573</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Titled dialogs use DSM's 3px corners and stay within the DSM window.</li>\n<li>Two messages that showed as raw keys now have text in every language.</li>\n<li>Built on SDK 0.12.2 and UI 0.10.3; no new approval is needed after the upgrade from 0.1.1-1572.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Package: <code class=\"notranslate\">synopackageland/SynoReclaim</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://synopkgland.com/apps/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Browse packages</a></p>",
